          "measure": "Detection of Endometriosis",
          "description": "Comparisons will be made descriptively between conventional MRI imaging, FES PET/MRI imaging and surgical/pathologic findings. Outcome data include number of detected lesions, differences in the accuracy for detection of active disease versus inactive fibrosis, and confidence score.",
          "timeFrame": "24 months"
        }
      ]
